P actions make_etude
P memjob 1000000
P memory_limit 1000.0
P mode interactif
P nomjob AsterStatic
P version stable
A memjeveux 2048.0
A args -max_base 300000
A tpmax 9000.0
F comm AsterStaticparam.in D 1
F comm AsterStatic.comm D  1
F mess AsterStatic.log R  6
F mmed AsterStaticinput.med D  20
F rmed AsterStaticoutput.rmed R  80
F libr AsterStatic_objective.csv R  27
